    rv32imac_decode_spec_needs_m_extension_and_jump_branch_decode_2026-11-27, P3, fixed, "rv32_decode_spec needs an M-extension ALU decode and an opcode-aware branch/jump decode that riscv_common lacks (6 cases red)", test/01_unit/hardware/rv32imac/rv32_decode_m_ext_jump_spec.spl, 1, bin/simple run test/01_unit/hardware/rv32imac/rv32_decode_m_ext_jump_spec.spl, 2026-11-27, 2026-11-27, true

bug_investigation_logs |bug_id, line_num, content|
    rv32imac_decode_spec_needs_m_extension_and_jump_branch_decode_2026-11-27, 1, "2026-11-27 w4-3: added M-extension AluOp variants (Mul, Mulh, Mulhsu, Mulhu, Div, Divu, Rem, Remu) and BranchOp.{Jal, Jalr, None} in src/hardware/riscv_common/pkg/riscv_types_pkg.spl; updated decode_alu_op (OP_OP + F7_MULDIV, preserving OP_OP_IMM) and decode_branch_op(opcode_or_funct3, funct3 = -1) for both 2-arg (opcode, funct3) and legacy 1-arg RV64 calls in src/hardware/riscv_common/core/riscv_decode.spl; removed @tag:in-development and expanded rv32_decode_m_ext_jump_spec.spl (10/10 PASS, rv32_decode_spec.spl 8/8 PASS, rv32_compressed_spec.spl 7/7 PASS, rv64_decode_spec.spl 34/34 PASS in --mode=interpreter)."
    rv32imac_decode_spec_needs_m_extension_and_jump_branch_decode_2026-11-27, 0, "2026-11-27: imports retargeted to riscv_common; before that the spec reported outcome=ERROR, executed=0 (unresolvable import). After the split: rv32_decode_spec 8/8, rv32_decode_m_ext_jump_spec 6 examples, 6 failures (maps MUL, maps BEQ/BNE/JAL/JALR, returns None for non-branch) on both the interpreter and the JIT."

